o-app-ai-agent-app-store\",\"title\":\"Apple lavora a un piano per consentire app con AI agent su App Store\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo The Information, Apple sta progettando un sistema per supportare app con AI agent e funzioni di AI coding su App Store, mantenendo sicurezza e privacy.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Liquid-Glass-App-Store-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Liquid-Glass-App-Store-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14565,\"date\":\"2026-05-04T10:23:04+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-04T08:23:04+00:00\",\"slug\":\"tim-cook-domanda-macbook-neo-fuori-scala\",\"title\":\"Tim Cook: domanda MacBook Neo “fuori scala”\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Tim Cook, la risposta dei clienti al MacBook Neo è stata “off the charts” e l’offerta non riesce a stare al passo: consegne stimate in 2-3 settimane.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/macbook-neo-product-film-feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macbook-neo-product-film-feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14433,\"date\":\"2026-04-25T12:32:18+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-25T10:32:18+00:00\",\"slug\":\"annunci-in-arrivo-su-apple-maps-questa-estate-cosa-aspettarsi\",\"title\":\"Annunci in arrivo su Apple Maps questa estate: cosa aspettarsi\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple prevede di mostrare annunci nell’